            <ArticleTitle>Aligning patient care and asthma treatment guidelines.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S416-21; quiz S427-33</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article describes how the National Asthma Education and Prevention Program Guidelines for the Diagnosis and Management of Asthma can be used in the clinical setting to improve a patient's everyday function and quality of life. Major recommendations are detailed and case studies provide a practical approach for patient management.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
